"<AccordionItem title=\"Завантаження з вебсайту Hugging Face\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
